// A variable initialised by a call, with nothing ever reading it. The store
// still happens at the point of declaration (§5), so the slot must survive
// pruning - this used to crash the compiler with `internal: unresolved symbol`
// once pruning dropped the symbol and the emitter met the store. Found during
// §75's build; DECISIONS §75 has the record.

u8 bright() {
  return 9
}

u8 level = bright()
